k><name>ARAKI YOSHIFUMI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OYOSHI TAKESHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ARAKI, YOSHIFUMI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OYOSHI, TAKESHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A photosensitive resin composition containing bis(3,5-di-t-butyl-4-hydroxybenzyl) sulfide. Since the composition contains the specific stabilizer, it is inhibited from thermally discoloring or gelling. It is hence a thermally stable, photosensitive resin composition which has excellent storage stability and is not inhibited from undergoing a photopolymerization reaction.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne une composition de résine photosensible à base de bis (3,5-di-t-butyl-4-hydroxybenzyl) sulfure. Ladite composition est protégée contre la décoloration ou la gélification thermique, car elle renferme l'agent stabilisant spécifié, ce qui lui confère les propriétés suivantes: stabilité thermique, excellente stabilité au stockage et possibilité de réaction de photopolymérisation.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>